    "sample_id": "helpsteer3:train:00e44b7b8abef0690ec886457466d328f2f5be23f79fcdcb368de79149c47ad9",
    "task": "Very much my squad in the game Genshin Impact: Nahida, Yanfei, Raiden, Kokomi.",
    "chosen": "That sounds like a formidable team in Genshin Impact! Here's a brief overview of each character and how they can contribute to your squad:\n\n1. Nahida (also known as the Dendro Archon, Kusanali): As the newest addition to the game, Nahida is a powerful Dendro catalyst user. She excels in applying Dendro to enemies, enabling various elemental reactions like Bloom, Burning, and Catalyze. Her Elemental Skill and Burst can provide crowd control, healing, and damage amplification, making her a versatile support character.\n\n2. Yanfei: A legal advisor and a Pyro catalyst user, Yanfei is a strong main DPS character. Her attacks generate Scarlet Seals, which can be consumed to enhance her Charged Attacks. Yanfei's Elemental Skill and Burst deal significant Pyro damage and can be used to trigger powerful elemental reactions with Nahida's Dendro application.\n\n3. Raiden Shogun (Baal): The Electro Archon, Raiden Shogun, is a powerful Electro polearm user and an excellent sub-DPS or support character. Her Elemental Skill provides energy regeneration for the entire team, while her Elemental Burst deals massive Electro damage and grants her the ability to infuse her normal, charged, and plunging attacks with Electro for a short duration. Raiden Shogun can work well with Nahida and Yanfei to trigger Overloaded and Hyperbloom reactions.\n\n4. Sangonomiya Kokomi: The Divine Priestess of Watatsumi Island, Kokomi is a Hydro catalyst user and a fantastic healer. Her Elemental Skill creates a healing zone that follows the active character, while her Elemental Burst transforms her into a powerful Hydro damage dealer and grants her increased healing capabilities. Kokomi can work well with Nahida to trigger the Bloom reaction, creating Dendro cores that can be detonated for additional damage.\n\nThis team composition offers a great balance of damage, healing, and elemental reactions. Make sure to equip your characters with suitable weapons and artifacts to maximize their potential and enjoy your adventures in Teyvat!",
    "rejected": "That's a cool squad you've got there in Genshin Impact! Nahida, Yanfei, Raiden, and Kokomi each bring unique abilities and playstyles to your team. Here's a brief overview of their characters:\n\n1. Nahida: Nahida is a powerful Electro user with a unique skill that allows her to deal massive damage to enemies. She's a great choice for dealing with groups of enemies and can be a valuable asset in both PVE and PVP.\n\n2. Yanfei: Yanfei is a Cryo user with a strong focus on crowd control. Her skills can slow down enemies and deal significant damage, making her a great choice for controlling the battlefield and supporting your team.\n\n3. Raiden: Raiden is a Hydro user with a versatile skill set. He can deal damage, heal allies, and even provide utility with his unique abilities. Raiden is a great support character and can be a valuable asset in any team composition.\n\n4. Kokomi: Kokomi is a Cryo user with a unique skill that allows her to deal damage to enemies and heal allies at the same time. She's a great choice for teams that need both offense and defense, and her playful personality makes her a fun addition to any squad.\n\nTogether, these characters can form a well-rounded team with a mix of damage, control, and support abilities. Keep exploring the world of Teyvat and have fun with your squad!",
